// Microsoft Defender Protection Changed From PowerShell
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_defender_tampering.yml (9b7037d5-bf17-4c4e-9d13-04c5628bc593)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1685 Disable or Modify Tools
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and ((process.command_line like~ ("*Set-MpPreference*", "*Add-MpPreference*")) and (process.command_line like~ ("*DisableRealtimeMonitoring*", "*DisableBehaviorMonitoring*", "*DisableIOAVProtection*", "*DisableScriptScanning*", "*ExclusionPath*", "*ExclusionProcess*", "*ExclusionExtension*")))
